@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-ink mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Last updated: September 17, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>When you create an account or submit a rental application, we collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, residential history, and other details you provide in the application wizard.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use your information to process rental applications, communicate application status, issue leases when approved, and operate the HomePlace property management platform. Property managers may review application details for properties they manage.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2">3. Sharing</h2>
                <p>Application information is shared with the property management role for the units you apply to. Internal notes written by property managers are confidential and are not returned to applicants.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2">4. Data Security</h2>
                <p>We use industry-standard practices to protect account credentials and application data. You are responsible for keeping your login credentials confidential.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2">5. Contact</h2>
                <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:privacy@homeplace.example" class="text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">privacy@homeplace.example</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
